<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Little Corner — Bánh Trung Thu 2025</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Quicksand:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --green:#233524;
    --green-deep:#152218;
    --green-soft:#EDF1E7;
    --gold:#D9A94D;
    --gold-deep:#B4812C;
    --pink:#E7A9B4;
    --pink-deep:#C96B7E;
    --cream:#FBF6EA;
    --ink:#2B2A28;
    --ink-soft:#7A756C;
    --white:#FFFFFF;
    --card-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(20,30,20,0.14);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--cream);
    padding-bottom:60px;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
    color:var(--green);
    margin:0;
  }
  [contenteditable="true"]{ cursor:text; border-radius:4px; }
  [contenteditable="true"]:hover{ background:rgba(217,169,77,0.14); }
  [contenteditable="true"]:focus{ background:rgba(217,169,77,0.22); outline:2px solid var(--gold); }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  .topbar{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:60;
    background:rgba(251,246,234,0.94);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(35,53,36,0.12);
  }
  .topbar-inner{
    max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px;
    padding:10px 20px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .brand{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .brand-name{ font-family:'Baloo 2',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:17px; color:var(--green); }
  .brand-tag{ font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold-deep); font-weight:700; }
  .back-link{
    font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px;
    color:var(--green); text-decoration:none; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;
    padding:8px 14px; border-radius:20px; background:var(--green-soft); transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  .back-link:hover{ background:#e2e9d9; }
  .nav-actions{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .admin-toggle{
    border:none; cursor:pointer; flex-shrink:0; width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%;
    background:#EDF2E7; font-size:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    opacity:0.55; transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .admin-toggle:hover{ opacity:1; }
  .admin-toggle.active{ background:var(--green); opacity:1; }
  .admin-toggle.logged-in{ background:var(--green-soft); }
  .edit-btn{
    display:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; flex-shrink:0;
    background:var(--green); color:white; font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif;
    font-weight:700; font-size:12.5px; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:20px;
    align-items:center; gap:5px;
  }
  body.edit-mode .edit-btn{ display:flex; }
  .edit-btn.export{ background:var(--pink-deep); }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
    min-height:460px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    text-align:center; color:white;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(21,34,24,0.55), rgba(21,34,24,0.82)),
               url('images/mooncake-box-lotus.jpg') center 30%/cover no-repeat;
  }
  .hero-inner{ max-width:720px; padding:60px 24px; position:relative; z-index:2; }
  .hero-kicker{
    display:inline-block; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:3px;
    text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .hero-title{ font-size:50px; line-height:1.15; font-weight:800; color:white; }
  .hero-desc{ font-size:16px; color:#EDE7D6; margin-top:16px; line-height:1.6; max-width:520px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }
  .hero-cta{
    margin-top:26px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    background:var(--gold); color:var(--green-deep); font-family:'Baloo 2',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:15px;
    padding:13px 26px; border-radius:30px; text-decoration:none; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(217,169,77,0.35);
    border:none; cursor:pointer; transition:transform .15s ease;
  }
  .hero-cta:hover{ transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .hero-note{ margin-top:14px; font-size:12.5px; color:#CFC9B6; }

  /* ---------- INFO STRIP ---------- */
  .info-strip{
    max-width:1180px; margin:-34px auto 0; padding:0 20px; position:relative; z-index:5;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:16px;
  }
  .info-card{
    background:white; border-radius:16px; box-shadow:var(--card-shadow);
    padding:18px 20px; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .info-icon{ font-size:22px; line-height:1; }
  .info-title{ font-family:'Baloo 2',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:14.5px; color:var(--green); margin-bottom:3px; }
  .info-desc{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.45; }

  /* ---------- SECTION HEADERS ---------- */
  .section{ max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:70px 20px 10px; }
  .section-head{ text-align:center; margin-bottom:40px; }
  .section-kicker{
    display:inline-block; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:2.5px;
    text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--pink-deep); margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .section-title{ font-size:32px; font-weight:800; }
  .section-sub{ font-size:14.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:10px; max-width:520px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }

  /* ---------- PRODUCT GRID ---------- */
  .grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap:24px;
  }
  .card{
    background:white; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:var(--card-shadow);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; border:1px solid rgba(35,53,36,0.06);
    position:relative;
  }
  .card-badge{
    position:absolute; top:12px; left:12px; z-index:3;
    background:var(--pink-deep); color:white; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700;
    padding:4px 11px; border-radius:12px; letter-spacing:0.3px;
    min-width:20px; min-height:12px;
  }
  .card-del{
    position:absolute; top:10px; right:10px; z-index:5; display:none;
    width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:50%; border:none; cursor:pointer;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92); color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:12px; font-weight:700;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }
  body.edit-mode .card-del{ display:flex; }
  .card-del:hover{ background:var(--pink-deep); color:white; }
  .card-img{ height:190px; background-size:cover; background-position:center; position:relative; }
  .card-body{ padding:16px 18px 18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; flex:1; }
  .card-name{ font-family:'Baloo 2',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:17px; color:var(--green); margin-bottom:4px; }
  .card-desc{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.55; margin-bottom:12px; }
  .card-meta{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:14px; }
  .card-meta b{ color:var(--ink); }
  .price-row{
    margin-top:auto; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    background:var(--green-soft); border-radius:12px; padding:10px 12px;
  }
  .price{ font-family:'Baloo 2',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; color:var(--pink-deep); outline:none; }
  .qty-stepper{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .qty-btn{
    width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:50%; border:1.5px solid var(--pink-deep); background:white;
    color:var(--pink-deep); font-weight:700; font-size:14px; cursor:pointer; line-height:1;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; transition:all .12s ease;
  }
  .qty-btn:hover{ background:var(--pink-deep); color:white; }
  .qty-val{ min-width:16px; text-align:center; font-weight:700; font-size:13.5px; }
  .add-btn{
    border:none; cursor:pointer; background:var(--green); color:white; font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif;
    font-weight:700; font-size:12.5px; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:20px; transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  .add-btn:hover{ background:var(--green-deep); }
  .add-btn:disabled{ background:#B7C2AF; cursor:default; }
  .add-product-card{
    display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;
    border:2px dashed #C9D2BE; border-radius:20px; min-height:220px; cursor:pointer;
    color:var(--green); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); transition:background .15s ease;
  }
  body.edit-mode .add-product-card{ display:flex; }
  .add-product-card:hover{ background:white; }
  .add-product-plus{ font-size:30px; font-weight:800; line-height:1; }

  /* ---------- GALLERY / SHOWCASE ---------- */
  .showcase{
    max-width:1180px; margin:70px auto 0; padding:0 20px;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr; gap:26px; align-items:center;
  }
  .showcase-img{ border-radius:22px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:var(--card-shadow); }
  .showcase-img img{ display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .showcase-text h3{ font-size:24px; margin-bottom:12px; }
  .showcase-text p{ font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.7; }
  .showcase-list{ margin-top:16px; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  .showcase-list li{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:flex-start; }
  .showcase-list li::before{ content:'✿'; color:var(--pink-deep); flex-shrink:0; }

  /* ---------- CART FAB ---------- */
  .cart-fab{
    position:fixed; right:20px; bottom:20px; z-index:100;
    background:var(--green); color:white; border:none; border-radius:30px;
    padding:15px 22px; font-family:'Baloo 2',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:14.5px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(21,34,24,0.4);
  }
  .cart-fab .count{
    background:var(--gold); color:var(--green-deep); border-radius:50%; min-width:22px; height:22px; padding:0 5px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:11.5px;
  }

  /* ---------- OVERLAY / PANEL ---------- */
  .overlay{
    position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(20,25,15,0.5); z-index:200;
    display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:16px;
  }
  .overlay.open{ display:flex; }
  .panel{
    background:white; width:100%; max-width:540px; border-radius:22px;
    max-height:88vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column; padding:24px;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .panel-scroll{ overflow-y:auto; padding-right:4px; }
  .panel h3{ font-size:21px; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .panel-sub{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:6px; }
  .panel-close{ position:absolute; top:16px; right:20px; border:none; background:none; font-size:22px; cursor:pointer; color:var(--ink-soft); }

  .cart-items{ margin:16px 0; }
  .cart-item{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:10px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--green-soft); font-size:13.5px; gap:8px;
  }
  .cart-item-name{ flex:1; }
  .cart-item-name b{ color:var(--green); }
  .cart-item-remove{ border:none; background:none; color:var(--pink-deep); font-size:12px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:700; }
  .cart-empty{ text-align:center; color:var(--ink-soft); padding:30px 0; font-size:13.5px; }
  .cart-total-row{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-weight:800; font-size:17px;
    color:var(--green); padding-top:12px; border-top:2px solid var(--green-soft); margin-top:4px;
  }
  .cart-actions{ display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:16px; }
  .btn{
    border:none; cursor:pointer; border-radius:16px; padding:12px 16px; font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif;
    font-weight:700; font-size:13.5px; flex:1; transition:transform .1s ease;
  }
  .btn:active{ transform:scale(0.98); }
  .btn-primary{ background:var(--green); color:white; }
  .btn-primary:hover{ background:var(--green-deep); }
  .btn-secondary{ background:var(--green-soft); color:var(--green); }

  /* ---------- ORDER FORM ---------- */
  .form-group{ margin-bottom:14px; }
  .form-label{ font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--green); margin-bottom:6px; display:block; }
  .form-hint{ font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:5px; }
  .form-input, .form-textarea{
    width:100%; padding:11px 14px; border-radius:12px; border:1.5px solid #E6E1D2;
    font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; outline:none; background:var(--cream);
  }
  .form-input:focus, .form-textarea:focus{ border-color:var(--green); background:white; }
  .form-textarea{ resize:vertical; min-height:64px; }
  .form-error{ color:#C0392B; font-size:11.5px; margin-top:5px; min-height:14px; }

  .confirm-box{
    background:var(--green-soft); border-radius:16px; padding:16px 18px; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.7;
  }
  .confirm-box b{ color:var(--green); }

  /* ---------- AUTH ---------- */
  .auth-hint{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:4px 0 14px; line-height:1.5; }
  .auth-error{ color:#C0392B; font-size:12.5px; margin-top:10px; min-height:16px; }

  /* ---------- TOAST ---------- */
  .toast{
    position:fixed; left:50%; bottom:24px; transform:translate(-50%, 20px);
    background:var(--green); color:white; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:12px;
    font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); z-index:300;
    opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }
  .toast.show{ opacity:1; pointer-events:auto; transform:translate(-50%, 0); }

  footer{
    margin-top:70px; padding:34px 20px 40px; text-align:center;
    background:var(--green); color:#D8DFCF;
  }
  footer .fname{ font-family:'Baloo 2',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:18px; color:white; }
  footer .ftag{ font-size:12px; color:#AEBBA0; margin-top:6px; }
  footer .fcontact{ margin-top:16px; }
  footer .fcontact-link{
    color:white; font-weight:700; font-size:13.5px; text-decoration:none;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12); padding:8px 16px; border-radius:16px;
  }

  @media (max-width:760px){
    .hero-title{ font-size:36px; }
    .info-strip{ grid-template-columns:1fr; margin-top:-24px; }
    .showcase{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <div>
        <div class="brand-name">Little Corner</div>
        <div class="brand-tag">Mooncake Festival</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a class="back-link" href="thucdon.html">← Về trang thực đơn</a>
      <button class="admin-toggle" id="adminToggle" title="Chế độ chỉnh sửa (Admin)" onclick="handleAdminClick()">⚙️</button>
      <button class="edit-btn save" id="saveBtn" onclick="saveContent(true)">💾 Lưu</button>
      <button class="edit-btn export" onclick="exportSite()">⬇ Xuất file</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-kicker" id="heroKicker" contenteditable="false">Tết Trung Thu 2025</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title" id="heroTitle" contenteditable="false">Đặt bánh trước, trọn vẹn mùa trăng</h1>
    <p class="hero-desc" id="heroDesc" contenteditable="false">Chọn vị bánh yêu thích, hẹn ngày nhận bánh — chúng mình sẽ liên hệ xác nhận đơn trong vòng 24 giờ.</p>
    <button class="hero-cta" onclick="document.getElementById('menu').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">🌕 Chọn bánh ngay</button>
    <div class="hero-note" id="heroNote" contenteditable="false">Đặt trước ít nhất 2 ngày để chúng mình chuẩn bị bánh tươi ngon nhất</div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="info-strip">
  <div class="info-card">
    <div class="info-icon">📅</div>
    <div>
      <div class="info-title">Pre-order linh hoạt</div>
      <div class="info-desc">Chọn ngày nhận bánh mong muốn, sớm nhất sau 2 ngày kể từ lúc đặt.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="info-card">
    <div class="info-icon">🪷</div>
    <div>
      <div class="info-title">Hộp quà sang trọng</div>
      <div class="info-desc">Thiết kế hộp hoa sen, dây quai tinh tế — sẵn sàng làm quà biếu.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="info-card">
    <div class="info-icon">📞</div>
    <div>
      <div class="info-title">Xác nhận qua điện thoại</div>
      <div class="info-desc">Đội ngũ Little Corner sẽ gọi lại xác nhận đơn ngay khi bạn gửi thông tin.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section" id="menu">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="section-kicker">Thực đơn Trung Thu</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Bánh trung thu handmade</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Vỏ bánh nướng vàng óng, nhân đầy đặn — mỗi chiếc đều được làm thủ công theo từng đơn đặt.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid" id="productGrid"></div>
</section>

<div class="showcase">
  <div class="showcase-img">
    <img src="images/mooncake-cross-section.jpg" alt="Lát cắt bánh trung thu Little Corner">
  </div>
  <div class="showcase-text">
    <h3>Nhân bánh đa dạng, đầy ắp trứng muối</h3>
    <p>Mỗi vị bánh là một câu chuyện riêng — từ vị truyền thống đậm đà đến những lựa chọn nhẹ nhàng, thanh mát cho cả gia đình.</p>
    <ul class="showcase-list">
      <li>Trứng muối nguyên viên, béo bùi</li>
      <li>Vỏ bánh mỏng, nướng vàng đều</li>
      <li>Không chất bảo quản, làm theo đơn</li>
      <li>Đóng hộp quà tặng lịch sự, sang trọng</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:60px;">
  <div class="showcase" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;">
    <div class="showcase-text">
      <h3>Set quà tặng trọn bộ</h3>
      <p>Hộp bánh phối cùng hộp giấy hoa sen, dây quai lụa xanh rêu — món quà Trung Thu ý nghĩa gửi đến người thân, đối tác.</p>
      <ul class="showcase-list">
        <li>Chọn từng vị bánh theo ý thích</li>
        <li>Tặng kèm vỏ hộp Trung Thu sang trọng</li>
        <li>Ưu đãi phí ship theo từng set quà</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase-img">
      <img src="images/mooncake-box-open.jpg" alt="Hộp quà Trung Thu Little Corner">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<button class="cart-fab" onclick="toggleCart(true)">
  🛍️ Giỏ hàng <span class="count" id="cartCount">0</span>
</button>

<!-- CART OVERLAY -->
<div class="overlay" id="cartOverlay">
  <div class="panel">
    <button class="panel-close" onclick="toggleCart(false)">×</button>
    <h3>Giỏ hàng của bạn</h3>
    <div class="panel-sub">Kiểm tra lại bánh đã chọn trước khi đặt hàng nhé</div>
    <div class="panel-scroll">
      <div class="cart-items" id="cartItems"></div>
      <div class="cart-total-row">
        <span>Tổng cộng</span>
        <span id="cartTotal">0đ</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cart-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="toggleCart(false)">Tiếp tục chọn bánh</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="goCheckoutBtn" onclick="openCheckout()">Đặt hàng →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- CHECKOUT OVERLAY -->
<div class="overlay" id="checkoutOverlay">
  <div class="panel">
    <button class="panel-close" onclick="toggleCheckout(false)">×</button>
    <h3>Thông tin nhận bánh</h3>
    <div class="panel-sub">Vui lòng điền đầy đủ để chúng mình liên hệ xác nhận đơn</div>
    <div class="panel-scroll">
      <form id="orderForm">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Họ và tên người nhận *</label>
          <input class="form-input" id="custName" type="text" placeholder="Nguyễn Văn A" required>
